#showas:移动利益
Mobile Interests introduces a new player type, the Ark Empire.  

Rather than a traditional homeworld, you'll command an Ark from the start of the game.  Take care;  you lose if it is ever destroyed!  The Ark gives you a more powerful fleet capability initially as well as a degree of flexibility in what planet to settle first, but you will not have access to the usual battlestations, or the economic boost that a Human Empire gets from the homeworld.  

Investing heavily in your Ark is recommended.  Ark Empire games allow you to choose which ship lines you will start with;  a flexible selection has been made for you in this case, or you can head to the lobby to customize those choices if you prefer.

A 'Wheel' galaxy awaits you, along with a pair of AIs at difficulty 6.  The Ensnarer specializes in tractor beams, while Overreactive will hit you with larger than usual counterattacks if you mount any ill-considered assaults on their worlds.  